# Input graph for _run_cq_sparql: a small enterprise ontology in the default
# namespace of the region's prologue (https://ontology.example.com/enterprise/),
# with classes, labels and provenance, plus a class that carries no label.
@prefix : <https://ontology.example.com/enterprise/> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .
@prefix prov: <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#> .

:Employee a owl:Class ; rdfs:label "Employee" ; skos:definition "A person employed" .
:Manager a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf :Employee ; rdfs:label "Manager" .
:Contractor a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf :Employee .
:Project a owl:Class ; rdfs:label "Project" ; prov:wasDerivedFrom :Charter .
:Charter a owl:Class .
<http://example.org/elsewhere/Thing> a owl:Class ; rdfs:label "Elsewhere" .
